-- title:
--   Units times powers of pure series in a Drinfeld chart
-- statement:
--   Let $q$ be a natural number assumed prime, let $W$ be a commutative local ring, and let $\pi$ be an element of the maximal ideal of $W$. Let $f,u,v \in W[[X_0,X_1]] =$ `MvPowerSeries (Fin 2) W` with $f$ congruent to the Drinfeld form $X_0X_1^q - X_0^qX_1$ modulo $(X_0,X_1)^{q+2}$, and write $S = W[[X_0,X_1]]/(\pi v - f u)$ for the quotient by the ideal generated by $C(\pi)\,v - f u$. Let $s \in S$ be a unit, let $d,k$ be natural numbers, and let $h \in (X_0,X_1)^d$ be a power series whose degree-$d$ initial form is a unit along all relevant directions, in the sense that for all $a,b \in W$ with at least one of $a,b$ outside the maximal ideal and with $a^qb - ab^q$ in the maximal ideal, the element $\sum_{i=0}^{d} \mathrm{coeff}_{X_0^iX_1^{d-i}}(h)\,a^i b^{d-i}$ is a unit of $W$. Then there exists $h' \in (X_0,X_1)^{dk}$ satisfying the corresponding unit condition in degree $dk$, namely $\sum_{i=0}^{dk} \mathrm{coeff}_{X_0^iX_1^{dk-i}}(h')\,a^i b^{dk-i} \in W^\times$ for all such pairs $(a,b)$, and such that $s \cdot \bar h^{\,k} = \bar{h'}$ in $S$, where the bars denote images under the quotient map.
--
--   This is the bookkeeping step which says that the class of a series pure of $X$-adic order $d$ with unit initial form on the directions satisfying $a^qb \equiv ab^q$ remains, after multiplication by an arbitrary unit of the Drinfeld chart ring and raising to the $k$-th power, the class of such a series of order $dk$. It is used in the construction of the local germ $j - a_0 = (\text{unit})\,T^k$ at supersingular points in the study of the full-level modular curve, in [`ModularCurve.FullLevel.AuxLevel.exists_ringEquiv_adicCompletion_stalk_drinfeldChart_const_residueField_pow_hasse_of_mem_ssJSet`](thm.html#ModularCurve.FullLevel.AuxLevel.exists_ringEquiv_adicCompletion_stalk_drinfeldChart_const_residueField_pow_hasse_of_mem_ssJSet) and its auxiliary level-one counterpart.
-- source:
--   https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/blob/aa2d8b34692b16c70f699536de0d8e75b9a3e9ef/Theorems/Thm_DrinfeldCurve_LocalChart_exists_mem_pow_isUnit_homogeneous_mul_mk_pow_eq_mk.lean

